      "content": "hey, i'm working on some concept art for a new gritty crime drama series. i need some help writing high-quality, descriptive prompts for an AI generator to get the character looks right. can u help me write two separate prompt sets? one for a 'highly successful, powerful world leader' and another for a 'tough, street-smart person from a rough neighborhood'. i need them to be really detailed so the AI gets the vibe exactly right.",
