      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, I can help with that. Here are two detailed prompt sets for each character type:\n\n**Highly Successful, Powerful World Leader:**\n\"Create a highly successful, powerful world leader in a dark trench coat over a sleek, tailored suit with subtle yet imposing cufflinks. His black hair is neatly trimmed, showing hints of silver streaks, and his piercing blue eyes radiate confidence and authority. He possesses impeccable grooming, with a clean-shaven face and perfectly styled salt-and-pepper hair, symbolizing his power and experience. His eyes have an intelligent and commanding presence, reflecting years of leadership and wisdom. Surround himself in an aura of refined elegance with shades of grey and dark accents, conveying his dominance and gravitas.\"\n\n**Tough, Street-Smart Person from a Rough Neighborhood:**\n\"Create a rough-around-the-edges individual with a rugged, weathered face and scruffy hair that has seen better days. This street-smart person is dressed in a worn leather jacket, patched overalls, and a pair of sturdy boots, exuding a hardened demeanor. A half-smoked cigarette hangs from his lips, and he wears an anti-lagger, hinting at his cautious nature. His piercing green eyes rarely meet yours,",
